Server init.

>> x := Blob sabo: 65 nauʼi: ['char'].
# for this test you need set a path to libc (puts)
>> libname := Shiri saiti: ['FFITESTLIB'].
Server haɗi: (
 Jeri sabo ;
 libname ;
 ['putchar'] ;
 ( Jeri sabo ; ['char'] ) ;
 ['void'] ;
 ['Print'] ;
 ['char:']
).
Print char: (x daga: 0 tsawo: 1), sabon-layi.
x saki.

